  "admission": "For C>1 or T>1: explicit hyperstack=true remains valid; an absent flag is also valid only when exactly one of C/Z/T is non-singleton. Explicit false for C/T remains refused, as does absence with multiple non-singleton axes. Explicit dimensions and full IFD-count agreement remain mandatory; missing singleton dimensions still enter the existing default ledger.",
